@subsection(@@smartart)

A laid-out diagram from a list: process (arrows), list (stacked), cycle (ring), hierarchy (org chart).

@smartart(process, Plan; Build; Ship)

@subsection(@@problem)

The task a student is set inside the module above it — marked by a named template, worth points, and openable in a live class like any other exercise.

@problem(bits.kmap-min, pts=10)
  Cover every min-term in at most 8 literals.
  minTerms = 0 2 5 7
  maxLiterals = 8
@end

@problem(template=bits.kmap-min, id=kmap-p1, time=8m)
Minimise F = sum m(0,2,5,7).
@end
